    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Lagoon 1.0.2</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:03:14 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>17</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Spotify: each person now uses the Client ID of their own Spotify app (step-by-step guide in Settings and in the README); Lagoon no longer ships one. Song lyrics were removed. A browser that stops responding no longer freezes the music player. Updated README.</p>]]></description>
